Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the magic energy flow is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, forgive me if this\Nis none of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wish to speak with\NLammis, I'd happily relay your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have much deeper\Nconversations with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis if I were to rely on Kikuyu's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, M-O. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me if such\Na request is presumptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm touched, but the first time I really\Ntalk to Lamas, it'll be on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go, and success!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's proceed through in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can start with Kikuyu's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Hulani.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lastly, us. Yeah. I'll\Nactivate it. Go ahead. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's with this red light?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found nothing out of\Nthe ordinary with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't want to be\Naway from Botto again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want us to be\Napart anymore either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could at least\Nall stay in one group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just let it send\Nus all to the same place.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside I'm just a big metal box\Nbut inside I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of\Nwonders I travel to and
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.36,0:01:36.24,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fro on the back of my\Nsuper strong partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas? The name's Boxo. Hello\Nthere. That means "yes" by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.11,0:02:56.94,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,438)\fscx72\pos(455,53)}The Dark Forest Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, Hulemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're both here. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness we're\Nall together. But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this room before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is maddening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was nothing wrong\Nwith the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everybody else went\Nthrough with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be wrong, but I saw something\Nstrange when we transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like some kind of red\Nlight coming from on top of Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.14,0:03:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The malfunction spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was cast on Boxo,\Nnot the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a damn magic symbol\Nstuck to Boxo's top corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a start, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My top corner? Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when it happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really got us good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the butt to have\Nas an enemy, that trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, there should be\Nno malfunctions next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like we'll have\Nto wait a few days for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Transfer Circle's\Nmagic power to recharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, this is the seventh stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, so is that the Dark Forest Stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hear it's a pretty dangerous\Nplace inhabited by lots of plant monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although from the look of\Nthings, nothing's been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is a tree growing right\Nin front of the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the way it's shaped, it looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a person. How creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creepy is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that there are monsters on\Nthis stratum that turn people into trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad news for women,\Nchildren, and the elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who can't put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hearing that, it's even\Nharder to look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must be here. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll happily deal with the carrot fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These monsters' bodily\Nfluids can be toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any gets on your boots, I\Nshall clean them off later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to fight some monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your help is appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ubuntu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't shake too hard! Shwing!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.28,0:05:13.04,sign_Arial,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H122853&\3c&H337CD4&\shad0\fs13}Fried chicken\NGrilled rice balls\NPasta with cream sauce\NHamburger combo\NHot dog\NFrench fries\NImagawayaki\NYakisoba\NTakoyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot how good his meat is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ain't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to have meat again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is naturally verdant all around\Na field bursting with vegetables aplenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat, however, is surprisingly scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder they're wolfing it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel isn't with you? He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Shui and I were sent\Nto this stratum, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, with Mishuel's strength, he's\Nprobably fine, no matter where he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all these people turned into trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd think at least some\Nhouses would be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters of this stratum are extremely\Nreluctant to harm any vegetation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even felled trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine they consider the\Nwood planks kindred beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I guess that means\Nthey get really angry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you cut down trees to build a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently you must go to great\Npains here to cut down even one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those strange trees we saw in the\Nvillage, were they once people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the women, children,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and people of a certain\Nage who inhaled the Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord's pollen during a\Nprevious monster attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's horrifying to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked anyone survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stratum Lords are formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they defeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, heavens no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They merely drove it away with fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they only use it as a threat for\Nfear it could burn down the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recall fire being banned on this\Nstratum, so that does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could easily defeat\Nthe Stratum Lord with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the trees of this stratum are\Nespecially vulnerable to heat and flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who turned into trees,\Nis there a way to turn them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe so, if the\Nstratum lord is defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems like it\Nwould be really hard to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find a stratum lord in a\Ngiant forest like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, finding the stratum\Nlord is the easiest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That giant tree guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing looks taller than a skyscraper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that thing ambulate without\Ncrushing all the trees in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that's one of the\NStratum Lord's powers, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it does move, all the\Ntrees scamper out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Stratum Lord that can control\Nplants in a forest, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like\Nit'd be easy to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can delve further into\Nthat subject tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at our comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're in no condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't eat anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say Shui won't be\Nof any use for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means guard\Nduty is up to us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it feels like it's been forever since you\Nand I got to be alone together like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\Nit does feel like forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might be kind of weird\Nto say, so don't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have this feeling that I can\Ndo anything as long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, thanks, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel that way too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks seems like an odd thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this deep, tender vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, what's happening? Is she...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this is the\Nstart of a kitschy rom-com
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between an inanimate object\Nand his girl best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh right, I forgot we\Nwere on watch. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you've been\Neating these monsters lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vegetable monsters here actually\Ntaste pretty good in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little gamey, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's plenty of lumber around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so luckily I won't run out\Nof arrows any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As requested, I brought\Nyou more arrows. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's Boxo on your back, so\Nyou must be the blessing of my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:08:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name is Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, then. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that you\Nfight bare-handed, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that seems like a waste\Nfor your blessing of might.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on over to my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find you a damn good weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is an otherworldly weapons shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, like, I don't even need any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't hurt to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he said you could have whatever\Nyou want as thanks for Boxo's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there'd be all kinds of cool stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I'm surprised to see some\Nwith magic stones built into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, my friends, what do\Nyou think of my shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to browse at your leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this? Oh, that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's water repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good in the hot or cold,\Nand it performs wonderfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's also flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just give me a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:09:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really surprised by\Nhow good it looks on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, just about anything\Nwould look good on Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think we should try to\Nget him to sell it to us later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, this one's a type of magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They get heavier the\Nmoment you pick one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Measuring stones, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty unusual\Nmagic item you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it out, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, you just make it look easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to try holding it, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lama's taking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it now! Ah! Close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was almost a hole in the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's skip over one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and pick up number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this one is super light, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how about the one at the end, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about as heavy as Boxxo. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're even stronger than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:10:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you your ultimate weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready! Dang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weapons merchant guy\Nis practically on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really do that? Heck yeah! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we have yet to meet\Nthe director of this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We dropped by the\NHunters Association right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away when we went to all the other strata.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I know Director Dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't met him as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, do you know what he's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would characterize\Nhim as cheerful and fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a good fit for\Nthe Stratum's director.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's not a bad guy by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these two not telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're curious about the director,\Nthis might be the perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Director Dark if you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'd be thrilled if\Nyou just remembered my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, how many guys do you have\Nthat look like a creepy shadow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the part where\Nyou're supposed to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkness Fiend's my race, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds all impressive, but my\Nvibe's all about having fun, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a real party guy at heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be a Darkness Fiend,\Nbut I like to keep things light!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My days are all hectic and messy\Nthinking about it makes me tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta sit down But it's my opinion\Nthat as director I've got to do
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my best to be dignified no matter\Nhow much it goes against my nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah You guys are from\NClearflow Lake Stratum, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that director Bear doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he keeps busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too! Doesn't he say every day is\Njust a total bear to get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He talks like a manzai performer\Nand this hail of cheesy jokes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is denting my surface I would\Ncharacterize him as cheerful and fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a good fit for\Nthe Stratum's director.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a bad guy. By any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains why those two\Ndidn't come along to introduce us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, why so stiff?\NYou nervous? Hey, loosen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess you're always the stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I'm told, Boxo\Ndispenses unusual food and drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call a magical item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should try it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do it, much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to encourage him,\Nbut this guy's a director.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I have to be nice to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.15,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HCFD2DD&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really can make stuff\Nfloat through the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never had a floating machine drink before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's tasty stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, really tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than I'd expect from sweet tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if only I had a\Nsweet tea pie by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to listen to dad jokes forever\Nif I don't do something, and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some way to outdo him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A manzai vending machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.63,0:13:47.18,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H89C1A8&\3c&H374F1E&\shad0\fs10\bord3\fad(1529,1)}Hot Coffee\NCafé au Lait\NLemon Tea\NMilk Tea\NHot Cocoa\NGreen Tea\NIced Coffee\NIced Café au Lait\NIced Tea\NIced Lemon Tea\NIced Milk Tea\NIced Cocoa\NIced Milk\NChilled Green Tea\NYour Smile ¥0
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.63,0:13:47.18,sign_Verdana,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\frz-34.09\pos(130,305)\fs8\fad(1529,1)\c&H1D4F99&\3c&H183222&\bord4\shad0}Vending {\c&H159898&}Venue {\c&H1D5DB7&}of Laughs
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, full house tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming\Nout to see us, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a pretty girl, pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, skip that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:13:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty girl? Cut that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ever tell you about how my mom\Ncan't remember her favorite novel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, maybe I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main character goes to another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, when a guy goes to\Nanother world, that's an easy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn from\Nthe old school, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing easy about it, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a difficult guy\Nhaving a real hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm also having a hard\Ntime with a typical guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming out today, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully this puts him\Nin his place for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.97,0:14:33.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(487,186)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fell some trees to make a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the monsters seem too\Ndangerous, we'll come right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our goal this time is to measure\Nhow powerful the enemies are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes our grand welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we deal with them first?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you even have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems like a total joker,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but apparently Director Dark used to\Nbe in the same group as Director Bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they fought side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's pretty handy\Nin a fight, goofy or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recall putting\Nveggies on my chopping list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the sake of my sanity, I'm\Ngoing to pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, there are fewer enemies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please remove some of the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's an amazing sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, let's call it a\Nday and head back. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how we spent the next few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clearing trees and extending\Nthe path through the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've covered a lot of ground,\Nbut there's been no movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to think it might be\Nfaster to just go look for the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Botan, Kuroyata, and Director\NBaron Kikuyu! Hey, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, how'd you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the transfer circle wouldn't\Nbe usable for two or three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know how we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the flow of magic power\Nseems to have settled a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I tried directing\Nit from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was able to activate\Nthe transfer circle that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it would take someone\Nwith your skill to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skill is one upside of growing old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, it's the\Ngirl with the appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui is your name, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that mess with\Nthe captain was difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I put all that behind me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My butt's asleep, are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and is it time to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shirley said lack of sleep\Nis the arch enemy of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even have the band\Nof gluttons with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Team Traveling Zoo is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the soft, cozy animal\Ntime one could ever want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:17:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to face the\Nmusic and go see Black Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My back pain just started flurrying\Nup out of nowhere in the match page.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but I need to tend to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I won't be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even try it, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you both know I\Ncan't deal with him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, he means Director Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikoyu, take care of you-know-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd be honored to. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, Director Bear asked me for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people currently in this village.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.24,0:17:42.08,sign_Arial,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H816121&\3c&HEBEDEC&\shad0\bord3\fad(398,1)}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that everyone on this stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time for me to distribute food,\Nso I think they're all going to gather.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.08,0:17:45.66,sign_Arial,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HAA8334&\3c&HF0F0F0&\shad0\pos(500,53)}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then as we discussed before, I will\Nhand out your products to each of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.42,0:17:52.67,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\b0\c&H51535A&\3c&HD1DEE4&\shad0\frx28\fry0\frz359.7\pos(281,49)}Deluxe Grilled Rice Balls
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.67,0:17:52.80,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\b0\c&H51535A&\3c&HD1DEE4&\shad0\frx28\fry0\frz359.7\pos(281,49)}Deluxe Grilled Rice Balls
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.42,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\pos(281,49)\b0\c&H51535A&\3c&HD1DEE4&\shad0\frx28\fry0}Deluxe Grilled Rice Balls
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, your name is Kikoyu, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've figured out what Kikoyu has in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll record her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikoyu was reading minds\Nas she handed over the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,box lunches in order to\Nsearch for the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.23,0:18:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is the Netherlord's commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of my hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That youngster's been working\Nhard here on this stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I had high hopes for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea she was working\Nfor the Netherlord! I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we don't know whether she was hiding\Nit all along or was persuaded to defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, what do we do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get information out\Nof her immediately, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have just the man for the job.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.77,0:18:51.56,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HCFD2DD&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy, we would like you to\Narrest and question the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any thoughts about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use hallucinations to gather\Ninformation, or perhaps affect her emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when it comes to apprehending the villain,\Nyou'd better leave the arrest up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This scandal happened on my watch,\Nso it's up to me to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't read his expression, but\NI could sense he was really angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As director, I imagine he\Nwants to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, anyone know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This room's well soundproofed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's going to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will use my sensory manipulation\Nto deactivate her sense
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of touch and pain and make\Nher believe she is dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will alter her vision to make\Nher think she sees the netherlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she will still be able to hear, so\Nplease refrain from speaking while I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If her sense of touch is muted, she\Nwon't know if somebody touches her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am speaking to you in your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must really appear to\Nher as the Netherlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then recount for me the circumstances\Nunder which you first began working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About two months ago, you\Nappeared before me as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said if I obeyed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd give me enough money\Nto pay off my gambling debt
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and live the rest of my\Nlife without having to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While purporting to defend\Nthe people as a hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would use this ring to\Norder the monsters to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct, and is that all you can remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About two weeks ago, I met with\Nmembers of the Menagerie of Fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,new recruits of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seemed to be looking for someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they left as soon as they\Nrealized they weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the captain and crew\Ndropped by this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were probably looking for the\Ntwo remaining Menagerie members.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you take off those\Nboots and show them to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro, don't forget you're\Nthe Netherlord right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, you want my boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some strange reason, I'm\Nfinding it difficult to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I shall carefully remove them myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that the scent gradually wafts\Nout and makes its way to my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've always had a problem with gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I always thought you could change!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'd loaned you money before,\Nyou said you'd never gamble again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a dope for believing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, that takes\Ncare of the Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we've got left now is to turn\Nthose trees back into people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.16,0:22:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.10,0:22:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a letter to the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a letter to the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a letter to the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.59,0:22:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a letter to the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward. I\Nlook forward to serving you again.
